# The two repositories CER-Intent is deployed and tested with, checked out next to this one:
#
#   ../tfs-ns3-digital-twin   the transport digital twin (NS-3.45 with the Ceragon module)
#   ../teraflowsdn            the TeraFlowSDN fork (Ceragon device driver and transport service
#                             handler), needed only by the emulated demo's TeraFlowSDN stand-in
#
# deploy/get-sources.sh (or .ps1) clones them at these refs; CI uses the same file.
TWIN_REPO=https://github.com/efidvir/tfs-ns3-digital-twin.git
TWIN_REF=feat/intent-translation
TFS_FORK_REPO=https://github.com/efidvir/teraflowsdn.git
TFS_FORK_REF=feat/etsi-alignment
